	(text "ADM1266 sequences every rail in the order the Versal and the AD9084 demand, logs faults, and is the only device allowed to release EN_* . The TX key is a physical break in TX_ARM, pulled down on the far side. LEDs report power, link and an actually-armed PA. They are single color, same lesson as Praline: the color is not the meaning."
		(at 20.00 18.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
		(uuid "c1f9f351-1f8f-594e-a6d8-6c8de02ceef6")
	)
